              <heading>Section 6DB (heading)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “<b>from 1978 to 1992</b>”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-2__amdact-1__item-3">
              <num>3</num>
              <heading>Paragraphs 6DB(a) and (b)</heading>
